 filename←GetBestConfigFilename pattern;folders;ids;order
⍝ Returns the name of the config file of the best release among the package folders in the
⍝ Registry that match `pattern`, or '' when no folder does.
⍝ "Best" is Tatin's order: by version number and, where that cannot decide, as with betas, by
⍝ publishing date.
 filename←''
 :If 0<≢folders←⊃F.Dir pattern
     ids←{⊃,/1↓⎕NPARTS ⍵}¨folders
     order←Reg.SortIndexForPackageIDs G.RegistryPath Reg.InjectPublishingDate ids
     filename←G.RegistryPath,(⊃⌽ids[order]),'/',Reg.CFG_Name
 :EndIf
